repository-code: "https://github.com/andygeorgi/evidence-at-human-scale"
abstract: >-
  A reference architecture, documentation contracts, a synthetic worked example and
  evaluation guidance for decisions that rest on what many systems and AI agents
  produce. This is a reference architecture, not a production deployment or benefit
  claim. The contracts and synthetic examples are tested; real-world effectiveness
  has not been evaluated.
